{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15mini_level_act15mini_st05",
  "groupId": "act15mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "歸鄉",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15mini/level_act15mini_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "05866d429f97dc543d75d13ac15bbd149ae288bc721b0f03e0b7769e23b3df0a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩米澤地薩滿",
      "text": "拉格娜，拉格娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩米澤地薩滿",
      "text": "你想要我們如何迎接你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩米澤地薩滿",
      "text": "無論向南還是向北，所有離開的人裡，最不可能回來的就是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "我知道，沒有人邀請我回來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "只是，我在水晶球中看到了一個預言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......我的兄長遭遇不幸的預言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "唔哦，好漂亮的木雕！這個坐在果殼裡的小人真的會指路嗎？真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "還有這個，異色的源石晶體！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "要用什麼樣的工藝，才能在雕刻的時候保持晶體穩定呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "不不不，把一塊源石放在家裡做擺件，是不是太危險了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "上次帶回去的源石冰晶碎片還沒有分析完，但是這個比起研究價值，更重要的是......真的很漂亮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯商隊成員",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我找找......去烏薩斯時準備的錢幣還剩下幾十切爾文！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "還是說，你們也和薩米本地人一樣，只接受用東西作交換？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那我可以拿一整罐調料來換——但那樣的話，西蒙娜姐和提豐就要陪我一起吃沒什麼味道的薩米食物了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "......我們本來就是薩米人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯商隊成員",
      "text": "......小姑娘，你想要什麼？沒有東西要換的話，我們就走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "欸，我是不是太吵了，哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "抱歉，沒想到還會有烏薩斯商隊到這麼遠的集市來做生意，還帶著這麼多我沒見過的東西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "唔，西蒙娜姐，你之前說我們要交換什麼來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "......咦，西蒙娜姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "唉。你真的沒聽見？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "沒、沒啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "剛剛有人認出了她，請她去幫忙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "有幾名死者的遺體被帶回了部族，但是部族沒有雪祀，所以他們拜託西蒙娜幫忙檢查一下遺體。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "欸，有人去世了啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "難怪我順著集市一路走過來，沒聽到什麼吆喝聲，也沒什麼人主動接我的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "大家看起來都好消沉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "唔，就連擺出來的東西也挺少的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那我們等等西蒙娜姐，讓她來做決定吧，是她說一定要來集市交換物資的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "可以嗎，來自烏薩斯的朋友？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......淌過薩米土地的流水啊，請接納我，我將與您的孩子們對話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "（低聲的哼鳴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "起風了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "從老樹最低的枝椏，到祖母瓦麗門前的火把......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "......慈悲的命運啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "既然他們已經同意，請檢查吧，寒檀木之女。他們的遺物都在這裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "一介黜人遊歷至此，得受霜槭之根系的信任，我很感激。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "這些武器上還結著暗紅的冰淩，他們經歷了一場苦戰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "他們是從北地陣線上被帶回來的戰士嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "嗯，這幾位戰士七八年前就離開部族去了北方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "誰能想到呢，辭別故鄉最久、最不肯回頭的兩位族人，在同一天裡回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "您是指死者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "......是一對分道揚鑣的兄妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "既然命運讓您在今天來到這裡，或許這個故事也該說給您聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "當年那場覆蓋半個黑森林的異常雪災，您一定記得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "我記得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "那時我們部族也受了影響。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "就和困在暴風雪中的其他部族一樣，我們祈求薩米的諭示，頂著風雪尋找樹上顯現的密文，想知道如何保全自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "但......我們是一個沒有雪祀的部族。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "我們祈禱啊，祈禱啊，但薩米回應的只有沉默。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "得不到命運的指引，薩滿們也無法判斷，是留還是走，要去往何處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "直到最後，那對兄妹堅定了想法，站出來領頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "但是，他們兩個人的想法截然相反。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "哥哥決定聽從埃克提爾尼爾的口信，帶一部分人前往北地陣線，為剩下的人停下雪災，使他們不必搬遷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "接受一位非本族雪祀的指引，的確是不得已而為之的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "但妹妹卻認為，部族已經無法生存，等待雪災停下只會熬死大多數人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "因此她領著另一部分人，憑著自己的法術一路占卜，避開危險，最終頂著風雪將部族南遷到了這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "這一路應該很不容易。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......對於雙方來說都是如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "所以我們理解，為什麼那兩個人如此怨恨對方，以至於各自一意孤行，再也沒回過頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "哈哈，我和大姐為了我撞斷她一支獸角裝飾的事，也吵過好幾個月呢。對他們的分歧來說，七八年的時間又算什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "他手鼓的側面，祝福的文字都這麼模糊了。要是他這幾年回來過一次，我一定會幫他仔仔細細重新雕刻一遍的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "啊，這面鼓......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "鼓面沒有沾上一點血跡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "但它的主人，那位薩滿巫醫，分明傷得很重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "恐怕......他受傷時武器根本不在手邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......他的毛皮長襖裡，還留有小半瓶伏特加。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "烏薩斯人用鋼鐵榨出來的苦飲，呵。他們也曾經與烏薩斯人一同坐在火邊，一同喝酒嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "您能否告訴我，是誰帶回了這些戰士的遺體？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "是一支烏薩斯商隊。怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“正在確認「黑印」狀態，「列巴羽」即將在水上人家交易。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "那支商隊——是否還在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "如果按照慣例，他們不會在集市停留太久。太陽落山了，前面的路就不好走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "謝謝，恐怕我必須動身去找他們......打聽一些情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "等一等，寒檀......您還會回來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "作為一個凋敝的部族，我們......想盡可能地請求幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "這次儀式對我們部族來說，意義重大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "不僅是死者的葬禮，也是生者告別家鄉的儀式。多一位博學的薩滿在場，族人們就能多得一份護佑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......舉族遷移。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "時隔近百年，薩米的意志再一次諭示如此多的部族向南搬遷嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "是的。這一次，薩米的意志看向了我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "而且，我們也認得出噩兆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲愁的薩滿學徒",
      "text": "新生的嬰兒整夜哭鬧不停，野獸死在水澤邊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "（恐懼的預兆。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "（可是，邪魔的污染竟然已經蔓延到了離冰原這麼遙遠的南部澤地？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "（抑或，烏薩斯人放入薩米的“黑印”其實是——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "您口中的噩兆，我或許有一些頭緒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "我答應您，會回來參加儀式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "但......眼下我另外有些事情要做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "亡者的靈魂在注視，生者須給予他們安寧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "——啊，沒有雪祀這麼糟糕嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "這個部族現在過得不好......都是因為沒有雪祀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "（記筆記）“雪祀透過占卜保護著部族。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "“沒有雪祀的部族，有時連接近的天災都無法察覺。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "這麼說，雪祀還要學習天災信使的課程啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "只靠學習可成不了雪祀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "我在苔原上，遇到過為了成為雪祀，在試煉中奄奄一息的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "唔，我還聽說過，有的部族會等待薩米的感召，成為雪祀的人都會得到一些來自奇跡的指示......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "算啦，這種事你還是問西蒙娜吧。我只是叫你別在集市上到處打聽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "這個部族......就像一隻重病的角獸。你要是總去戳它，叫人家起身，很煩人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "對不起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "唉，還有你給我挑的這個結繩手環，一點也不好看，還礙事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "欸嘿。我只是找個理由讓你陪我一起逛集市嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "你已經差不多是個完整的薩米人了，在南邊這種有鐵疙瘩的地方，已經可以自己出去玩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我就是覺得，有你陪著比較好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "不知道為什麼，我有種不好的預感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "......一般來說，你的預感會很靈驗嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "不會欸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "其實我一般什麼預感都沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "說說看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "你感覺到的東西，是像一頭裂獸的影子，還是一段巨木的裂痕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "不，都不像......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "等等，裂獸？欸，這裡還會有裂獸嗎？如果真的遇到了，能不能拜託你來處理？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "唉，上路之前我會把自我保護的方法再給你講一遍的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "我問的是，你的預感本身是什麼樣子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "對我來說，就是因為想不明白它具體是什麼，所以才叫它預感吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我只是感覺，好像有什麼東西已經離得很近了，可我卻沒注意到它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "對，就像抹掉這層雪，底下就是超級大發現，我卻直接從上面走過去了一樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "嘿嘿，雖然瑪麗老師總是說我確實會犯這種錯誤啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "啊——啊嚏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "欸，雪突然大了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "——啊，西蒙娜姐，你終於回來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "你們，見過一支烏薩斯商隊嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "見過呀，他們還送了我一個空酒壺，說什麼“陛下在上”“邊防軍不會喜歡，帶不回去”之類的。你看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我本來想等你回來，看看要不要跟他們交換一些東西，但是他們說時間不等人，就急匆匆地走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......你放他們離開了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "他們剛剛往那個方向走了。你找他們有事的話，現在應該還追得上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "西蒙娜，你在生氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "發生什麼事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "抱歉......只是，既然他們送了禮物，那我也應該懂得禮尚往來，僅此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "麥哲倫，提豐，你們跟著部族繼續往察帕特走，路上一定要注意安全，可以嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "一旦有任何異常發生，不要想著應對，儘快逃離，生存優先。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "你也一樣，西蒙娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "呵呵，不用擔心我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "我會很快回來，追上你們......我答應過他們，我會參加那些戰士的葬禮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "......麥麥，你在想什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "......啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我剛剛好像是在想，應該讓西蒙娜姐幫忙看看，這酒壺上的薩米文字到底是什麼意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "但是不知道怎麼就走神了，問題也忘了問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "算啦，先把酒壺收起來好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "拉格娜，他們回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "你的占卜還是那麼準。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "蒂拉今天真的空手而歸了，要知道，她現在可是我們部族最好的獵手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "還有，你看這手鐲，我弄丟好幾年了。我的小兒子找到了它，就像你說的，“幸運之事，自深水之中”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "以及......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "那漆黑的死亡，也確實降臨在了我們的戰士身上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "所以，我不得不問你，當年為什麼要那麼做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "為什麼明知占卜將我們引向北方，你卻要與之背道而馳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......抱歉，我只是回來見我的親人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "如果對葬禮沒有別的安排......我就先離開了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "拉格娜......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "隨她去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "她與薩米的土地已經沒有聯繫，我們沒必要苛責這麼一個可憐人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "欸，遠山姐，怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "他們還是不太喜歡你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "我已經預想到了會是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "唔......至少能在旅途中碰到朋友，說明今天運氣很好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我看到你的時候，還以為自己又出現幻覺了呢，真的好巧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "——呃，抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我聽說這裡有人過世了，該不會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "沒關係，我是占卜到了我兄長的死才回來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "原本我們也......因為一些事情，產生了巨大的分歧，很長時間沒有互通音訊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "可是，儀式裡職責最重要的薩滿，卻並沒有在準備葬禮啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......麥哲倫，你有個很敏銳的朋友呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "這不是什麼秘密。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "而且，如果只是普通地與死者告別，人們是不會這麼難過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "如果還有機會與死者告別，你也不至於這麼難過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "我原本以為，七年過去，樹會抽出新枝，大家也能在這片土地上牢牢扎根，過上安逸的日子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "結果我看到的，卻是我的族人被越來越頻繁的災害折磨，甚至不得不再次搬遷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "而薩滿們竟會為是否要舉辦傳統的葬禮而爭執不下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "唔......但是，要是一句話不說，那怎麼能叫告別呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "所有東西本來就會像羽獸一樣飛走，再也見不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "這種時候就算你出聲嚇到它們，也沒關係的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "我......從沒答應過不舉行葬禮。請您不要再提出這個建議了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "他們足夠幸運，回到了家鄉的土地，我們怎麼能把他們長久地留在寒夜裡，困在自己的肉體旁不得解脫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "這片土地很快就不再是我們的家鄉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "正因如此，他們才需要沉船歸鄉的儀式，才需要順著水流找到故人......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "災難就在眼前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "我知道——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "——他們就是災難的一部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "岩角獸沒日沒夜地發狂奔逃，直至力竭而死，這是預兆。在北地陣線上，此刻我們會吹起號角，徹夜警戒等待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "他們都是戰士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "戰士從無善終。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "那只是個傳言，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "您的命運，並沒有在前往北方冰原作戰之後變得一片漆黑，相反，您還獲得了薩米的諭示與祝福。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "可您卻出於戒心，想讓他們為自己的軀殼站崗放哨，直到屍身朽爛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "那裡躺著的也有您最心愛的學生啊，他此刻也正在聽您冰冷的言語。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "那就讓他聽吧，他是最堅毅的戰士，他會心甘情願領受這一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "——您說得對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "我們......為何不問問死者本人有什麼看法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "......看來那兩個外來人給了你某種盲目的勇氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "但是，你應該知道雪祀已經離開很久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "祖母瓦麗過世後，部族再沒有人受到過感召。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "還是說，你也主張改變傳統，不再等待感召，而是效仿那些主動為雪祀設立試煉的部族？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "我......可以嘗試占卜他們的意願。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "拉格娜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......是，我在請求命運擺佈我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "您不必質問，就直接稱我為出爾反爾之人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "那麼，我不會阻攔你的嘗試。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "......好吧，只要族樹願意抬起樹枝，讓你行船進入，那麼我也不會阻攔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "我們等待死者的回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "你不用趕著去察帕特嗎？我看你們南方人總是匆匆忙忙的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "比如，說是過來旅遊，但是你們的......唔，運輸工具，他們直直地開過來，一群人在空地上站一會，運具又直直地開走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "嗯，我當然很擔心瑪麗老師。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "可是，現在我要做的事情，就是盡可能收集薩米的資訊，方便搜救隊開闢路線呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "而且，我也想陪一陪遠山姐嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "在羅德島，大家都說，遠山姐情緒波動最大的時候，也就只有打牌輸掉的時候而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我都沒想過她會有現在這樣難過的表情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "你呢，提豐，那個在察帕特等著你的委託人很著急嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "嗯。其實我都不知道，等在南方城市的那個委託人到底是誰，又要我過去做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "大概又是有人想悄悄地託我處理麻煩吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "下次帶你去看看好了，有時候那些傢伙搞得神神秘秘的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "結果我從樹洞裡拿出來的木板，上面寫的只是有一隻死掉的角獸需要人搬走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "影子已經不在死去的角獸身邊了，不過，大部分人找不到它之後，心裡更害怕，只好找我幫他們處理了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "唔，這麼說，大家很信任你呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "難道他們不願意直接接近你，真的是覺得你的弓會帶來厄運？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那、那是不是就像......礦石病一樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "礦石病？不，不一樣，怎麼會一樣呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "西蒙娜得了礦石病，難道就不值得尊敬了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "但我......我也不確定自己是不是真的馴服了這把弓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "嗯......可是弓在你的手上，如果它不好用了，那感覺應該會跟我的無人機運轉不靈差不多？總會有什麼感覺的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "我醒的時候當然可以死死地盯住它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "可是我做夢的時候，意識從我的身體離開的時候呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "你們南方人聽過這樣的說法嗎？“談論厄運的人越多，厄運的陰影就越清晰。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "沒聽過？好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "以前我一直待在艾爾啟的洞窟裡，那個時候，沒有人認識我和我的武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "但現在可不一樣。我有這種本領，我要到處幫忙，把影子從薩米趕出去。與之相對應地......談論我的人也越來越多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "我也不知道厄運會不會突然發現我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "唔，我相信你的弓是不會出問題的......！因為我跟你一起走了這麼久也沒遇到問題嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "但這也的確不是嚴謹的證明方法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "對啦，要是能把你的武器帶給我的工程科同事們分析一下就好啦，說不定能給出一些解釋，我聽得懂的那種。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "而且他們還能幫你想想辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "比如說，梅爾還蠻擅長應對危險物品的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "嘿嘿，而且她和我關係超級好，肯定不會責怪我攜帶有潛在風險的武器衝進她的實驗室......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "......不過我們從北地帶回去的樣本，每個都要研究好久好久，我可不能把你的武器拿走好幾年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "（咦......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "謝謝你，你真努力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "但我說過，不要碰我的武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "這是只有我自己能處理的事情，艾爾啟也是這麼說的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "......麥哲倫，你在做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "放手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "麥哲倫下意識地鬆開手。隨著“撲通”一聲，她猛地回過神來，睜大眼睛盯著水潭上蕩開的漣漪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我......剛剛丟了什麼進去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "那個烏薩斯人送你的酒壺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "你剛剛在用它接沼澤裡的泥水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "唔，我教過你可以用衣服吸水濾掉泥沙，但是......你應該不是忘記了。你看起來不對勁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "欸......啊！真的欸，我剛剛又走神了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "我得把別人送我的禮物撈起來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "你不敢伸手，是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "把手給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "欸，這種情況你也有應對方法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "......呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "好像真的冷靜下來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "在手指上纏一根藤條居然這麼有用，你真厲害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "啊，你給自己也纏了一根。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "不過，你還是別去撈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "西蒙娜不是說了嗎？注意安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "好吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "......真奇怪，剛剛那個明明是我面對邪魔的時候才會有用的方法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "難道西蒙娜的提醒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......死者回答了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "多數人想要下葬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "只有一人......保持了沉默。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "沉默意味著至少不反對，是不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的薩滿",
      "text": "死者意願如此，我們必須尊重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴厲的薩滿",
      "text": "......既然如此，那就照常舉行葬禮吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "上船時小心，麥哲倫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "嗯，謝謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "這就是我們澤地部族的習俗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "入夜之後行船，流水推動木舟，到了船葬處，死者隨船沉入水底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "只有這樣，死者才能從軀殼的束縛中解脫，自在地行走林間，順著流水尋找自己血脈相連的族親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "只不過，這次葬禮，也是我們與故鄉告別的儀式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "所以大家會帶上家當，踏上船隻，和死者一起走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......死者沉船歸鄉，生者離開家鄉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麥哲倫",
      "text": "那我和提豐不是你們的親人，也不是部族成員，也可以跟著你們的船隊一起走嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "不如說，要謝謝你們願意和我同行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "我早已知道自己是孤身一人，在薩米之外的土地上流浪......但送行自己最後的親人，要獨乘一艘小船的時候，還是會覺得太過苦澀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......至少，葬禮能夠舉行，我的族人應該會感到慰藉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "無論生者，還是死者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "哎呀，你向我伸手，是需要我也扶你一把嗎，提豐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "只是你的手摸起來很冰涼，遠山。就像有很冷很冷的風一直吹著你，你只能不停地眨眼，將手緊緊攥在一起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "我一直都想問你一個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "在你的占卜中，死者究竟回答了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提豐",
      "text": "或者說，你占卜到的“沉默”，究竟是怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩米澤地居民",
      "text": "號角聲響了，別再回頭張望了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩米澤地居民",
      "text": "既然命運叫我們前行，那麼遺落在這裡的，總會歸還於我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩米澤地居民",
      "text": "撐船吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人們不再言語，船隊最前方，傳來薩滿低沉的歌聲。\n死者將追隨先靈而去，他們的名字被一一報出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "風吹響了載著遺體的小舟上的一串銅鈴。\n儀式已經開始，船隊就不會再回頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......我很抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四次占卜，我所見的景象依舊是“儀式”。\n那麼，第五次占卜，我向......拉瑟，發問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "拉瑟，我有話對你說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......不，或許是想聽你對我說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "從那場暴風雪中走出來的路很長，河始終沒有解凍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "我在薩米之外的地方生活，隨著鋼鐵的船隻漫遊。那艘船太穩，難免讓人夢見當時族人們拖著船在冰上走的情狀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "走到後來，很多人都沒有餘力再拖著船，有的人連自己的身體也拖不動了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......那條路上有太多的犧牲，因此我不敢再回頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "事實就是這樣。我只是不敢回頭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "我們的確做了截然相反的決定，的確曾為此拔出武器指向對方，但我並不是因為記恨你而不肯歸鄉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "......不過，對於駐守北地的戰士而言，如此事實，或許也無關緊要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "儀式甕中的樹葉已經快燃盡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "所以，請你......回答我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你為什麼——\n兄長啊，你為什麼還是不願意回應我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "黑暗，霧氣，黑暗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "空空的水晶球。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "text": "我怎麼會，什麼都看不見？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
